{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":64,"count":29,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-1-04\",\"誰\",\"誰\",\"谁\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她是誰？","pinyin":"Tā shì shéi?","english":"Who is she?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-04","sourceFront":"誰","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他是誰？妳知道嗎？","pinyin":"Tā shì shéi? Nǐ zhīdào ma?","english":"Who is he? Do you know?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-13","sourceFront":"嗎","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"宜文，她是誰？","pinyin":"Yíwén, tā shì shéi?","english":"Yiwen, who is she?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-01","sourceFront":"新","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) call carries to a 隹(bird) in the night, and the question comes back: 誰(who) is there?"},{"key":"[\"B1L06-3-12\",\"有的時候\",\"有（的）時候\",\"有（的）时候\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"有(there is) + 的(of) + 時候(time) → 'there are times': 有的時候 means sometimes."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-01\",\"着\",\"著\",\"着\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中明，你手裡拿著什麼？","pinyin":"Zhōngmíng, nǐ shǒu lǐ ná zhe shénme?","english":"Zhongming, what you are holding in your hand?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-01\",\"租\",\"租\",\"租\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想在學校附近租房子，去學校比較方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-01","sourceFront":"租","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這棟公寓有五層樓，四樓要出租。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-07","sourceFront":"出租","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個房子的房租不包括水費、電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-30","sourceFront":"電","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我的房東都是每個月五號來收房租的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-15","sourceFront":"收","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"到國外生活以前，得先找租房子的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我的房租每個月一萬塊，加上水費、電費，差不多一萬三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-22","sourceFront":"加上","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個房子又大又舒服，房租只要三千塊，真是太便宜了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-22","sourceFront":"真是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在台北市租房子太貴了，住在郊區可以省一點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-11","sourceFront":"省錢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟朋友打聽附近有沒有房子出租。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-01","sourceFront":"打聽","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他這個月花了太多錢，因此連水電費、房租都繳不出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-09","sourceFront":"繳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家店面的租金太高，所以一直租不出去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-04","sourceFront":"店面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然新租的房子空間不大，環境倒挺乾淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-54","sourceFront":"倒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場大型戶外活動因為租不到合適的地方，就被取消了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-49","sourceFront":"取消","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-36\",\"剩\",\"剩\",\"剩\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟把菜都吃完了，什麼都沒剩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我已經把衣服洗完了，剩下的家事請你做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-12","sourceFront":"剩下","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我父母這個週末都不在家，家裡只剩下我一個人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-12","sourceFront":"剩下","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"同事都走了，只剩下他一個人還在做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-13","sourceFront":"做事","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"剩下的飯菜加熱太多次，就沒什麼營養了，最好每餐都吃光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-21","sourceFront":"加熱","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在那場車禍中，那個孩子失去了父母，家裡只剩下他一個人，大家都很同情他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-21","sourceFront":"同情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"太太：你喝醉了，別再喝了。 先生：好啦，好啦，還剩下一口，喝完就不喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-02","sourceFront":"啦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"算算日子，剩下兩個星期經理就要退休了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-17","sourceFront":"日子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付完學費，我的獎學金只剩下三千塊，這個月只有吃饅頭過日子了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-07","sourceFront":"只有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我種了一些瓜，賣了五分之四，剩下的就全送人了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-40","sourceFront":"瓜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-43\",\"過來\",\"過來\",\"过来\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你忙不過來的時候就該找人幫忙，別讓自己累壞了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-09","sourceFront":"該","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧你來幫忙，要不然我一個人絕對忙不過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每次寫完考卷都會仔細檢查一遍，要是發現錯誤就馬上改過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的露營活動還欠什麼東西？我可以帶過來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-51","sourceFront":"欠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的頭部被棒球打中並當場昏迷，還好幾分鐘後就醒過來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-06","sourceFront":"昏迷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-26\",\"校友\",\"校友\",\"校友\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-13\",\"得到\",\"得到\",\"得到\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我想要得到便利商店的貼紙，所以花了很多錢買東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-26","sourceFront":"花","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"大學給我一封正式的信，通知我得到獎學金了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通知","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的新同事不但工作能力強， 也很負責，來公司沒多久就得到經理的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-29","sourceFront":"肯定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"寫劇本對我來說是個很大的挑戰，但是也能得到不少收穫，所以我願意試試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要得到好成績，除了努力用功，還得學習怎麼利用網路資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-05","sourceFront":"資源","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小文為了得到超商送的小禮物，每天都特地去那裡買咖啡、三明治。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-05","sourceFront":"特地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這雙球鞋的設計很特別，在百貨公司的專櫃才買得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-10","sourceFront":"專櫃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不管出國工作或留學，一定得買個平安保險，萬一發生什麼意外才能得到幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-34","sourceFront":"意外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些父母不讓孩子去夜店，主要是因為聽說那裡有人吸毒，也買得到毒品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-14","sourceFront":"毒品","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生滑雪的技巧很好，這次比賽他有信心能夠得到前三名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-29","sourceFront":"信心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你能掌握老師教學的重要內容，這次的測驗就一定能得到高分","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-15","sourceFront":"測驗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想得到獎學金，必須達成每科成績八十五分以上的要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-05","sourceFront":"達成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李導演付出了十年的時間，終於拍出了一部好電影，得到大家的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-18","sourceFront":"付出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本中文教材是網路書店出版的，你得上網才買得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-04","sourceFront":"出版","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路是很偉大的發明，就算不出門，也能讓人們得到全球各地的訊息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"信用卡的正面和背面都有一組號碼，在線上刷卡時用得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-12","sourceFront":"正面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你在銀行存的錢越多，得到的利息也越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-21","sourceFront":"利息","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家早餐店的生意很好，你得早點(兒)去，才買得到早點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-54","sourceFront":"早點","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有煩惱，如果能好好處理，就能從過程中得到經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-06","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:幸虧有你的建議，投資計畫才有很好的結果，真是多謝你了？ B:哪裡哪裡，都是你自己努力得到的成果，要謝就謝你自己吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-20","sourceFront":"謝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著空氣被汙染的情況越來越嚴重，得到癌症的機會也增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-20","sourceFront":"癌症","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"能得到觀眾熱情掌聲的表演，才算是有魅力的表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-20","sourceFront":"算是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-2-15\",\"後年\",\"後年\",\"后年\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想利用後年的暑假去英國遊學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-16","sourceFront":"遊學","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-33\",\"加油\",\"加油\",\"加油\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他明天要參加籃球比賽，我們去幫他加油吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-33","sourceFront":"加油","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他們班明天有一場籃球比賽，我想到現場替他們加油。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-09","sourceFront":"現場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看到自己國家的國旗進入奧運會場，民眾也不斷揮著手上的小旗子，替自己的國家加油。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-33","sourceFront":"旗子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-2-19\",\"樂觀\",\"樂觀\",\"乐观\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"陳可欣是一個勇敢、樂觀的人，什麼麻煩、困難的問題都不怕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-19","sourceFront":"樂觀","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一般人都喜歡跟性格溫柔、樂觀的人交朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-08","sourceFront":"性格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥的性格開朗、樂觀，遇到麻煩也不會往壞處想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-09","sourceFront":"開朗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-18\",\"微笑\",\"微笑\",\"微笑\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個店員經常對客人微笑，讓人覺得很親切。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-18","sourceFront":"微笑","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-29\",\"拒絕\",\"拒絕\",\"拒绝\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小李好幾次約女網友見面，都被拒絕，所以不再跟她聯絡了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-29","sourceFront":"拒絕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"林阿姨來我家推銷保險，我不好意思當面拒絕她，只好假裝有急事要出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-16","sourceFront":"當面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"你要大膽一點兒，不喜歡的事情就拒絕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-08","sourceFront":"大膽","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每次有人拜託他幫忙，他都沒拒絕過，因此大家都說他是「好好先生」(yes-man)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-06","sourceFront":"拜託","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車去喝喜酒的人碰到敬酒時最好拒絕，免得回家路上發生意外。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-51","sourceFront":"敬酒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 拒(defend) and 絕(cut): 拒絕 means reject."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-25\",\"单身\",\"單身\",\"单身\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"何先生早就習慣了單身生活，一點都不想結婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-25","sourceFront":"單身","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"人人都渴望浪漫的愛情和幸福的家庭，不過自由自在的單身生活也是不錯的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-29","sourceFront":"愛情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我國四十歲以下的單身女性人數，比去年增加了百分之十。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-40","sourceFront":"女性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-34\",\"收据\",\"收據\",\"收据\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要是新買的商品有問題，七天以內可帶收據到店裡處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-34","sourceFront":"收據","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"拿到購物收據，要是發現算錯帳了，就請店員再算一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-07","sourceFront":"算帳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-26\",\"浪费\",\"浪費\",\"浪费\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家超商食品賣不完就丟掉的作法，不但白白浪費食物，回收處理的成本也增加了，長期下來十分浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-26","sourceFront":"浪費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他用很珍貴的茶具來泡品質很普通的茶葉，真浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-07","sourceFront":"普通","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-19\",\"多谢\",\"多謝\",\"多谢\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:幸虧有你的建議，投資計畫才有很好的結果，真是多謝你了？ B:哪裡哪裡，都是你自己努力得到的成果，要謝就謝你自己吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-20","sourceFront":"謝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-32\",\"醫師\",\"醫師\",\"医师\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"醫師要我到廁所大便，再拿一點兒放在盒子送去檢查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-49","sourceFront":"大便","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他手上有傷，醫師建議他三日以內不要碰水，以免感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-37","sourceFront":"傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在中國北方，所謂的「大夫」就是醫師，做的是替人醫病的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-34","sourceFront":"醫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這位外科醫師不僅很會開刀，對病人也很有耐心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-21","sourceFront":"開刀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"今天王醫師門診，沒有護理師協助，什麼事都得自己動手。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-18","sourceFront":"動手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著科技進步，醫學也不斷前進，當醫師的人得多充實自己。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-41","sourceFront":"醫學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"火腿裡放了很多鹽巴，醫師不建議爺爺多吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-13","sourceFront":"火腿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-2-10\",\"勿\",\"勿\",\"勿\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開會前經理要求大家勿開手機，專心討論會議內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-10","sourceFront":"勿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-44\",\"工会\",\"工會\",\"工会\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"工會代表跟老闆討論工資問題，認為公司給的工錢仍然太低。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-45","sourceFront":"工錢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-36\",\"重复\",\"重複\",\"重复\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個字不好念，我重複了好幾次，同學都說不對，害我好想放棄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-36","sourceFront":"重複","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本小說的內容重複性太高，一點新鮮感都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-35","sourceFront":"重複性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那件事我已經跟你重複說過好多次了，你怎麼還問我？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-07","sourceFront":"重複","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-14\",\"摔\",\"摔\",\"摔\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他不小心摔壞了新買的手機，因此難過得要命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-14","sourceFront":"摔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"也好\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 也(also) and 好(good): 也好 means may as well."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"合理\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"When facts 合(combine) smoothly with logical 理(science) principles: 合理 means reasonable."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"吸收\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 吸(inhale) and 收(collect): 吸收 means absorb."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"寬\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Under a spacious 宀(roof), two 艹(leaves) spread wide so eyes can 見(see) each distinct corner 丶(dot): 寬(wide)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"曬\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 日(sun) rests on the 麗(beautiful) slopes → all 曬(sun-dry)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"發出\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 發(distribute) and 出(go out): 發出 means send out."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"遲到\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"遲(tardy) + 到(arrive) → arriving tardy means to come late."}]}
